OL,3,GNEWSAEx-world champion boxer Liam Smith
OL,4,A'punched man on floor'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer world champion boxer Liam Smith
OL,7,Fis alleged to have punched a man in the
OL,8,Fhead as he lay on the floor "unable to
OL,9,Fstand", a court heard.
OL,11,FSmith, who held the WBO
OL,12,Flight-middleweight title from 2015 to
OL,13,F2016, appeared for the first time at
OL,14,FManchester Crown Court earlier to face
OL,15,Fa charge of causing grievous bodily
OL,16,Fharm with intent.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
