OL,3,GNEWSAEx-world champion boxer Liam Smith
OL,4,A'punched man on floor'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 38-year-old, from Liverpool, was
OL,7,Fnot asked to enter pleas to the charge
OL,8,Fwhich followed his arrest for the
OL,9,Falleged attack on a concierge worker at
OL,10,FThe Blade tower block on Silvercroft
OL,11,FStreet, Deansgate, on 13 September.
OL,13,FAlleged victim Laurent Nke suffered
OL,14,Ffacial injuries and spent time in
OL,15,Fhospital, the court heard.
